# Training JSONL embeds patch/test/script content from an internal delivery -- not ours to
# redistribute via this repo. Distributed offline; there is no prepare script for it here.
#
# example.jsonl/example_rollouts.jsonl are the one exception, and are NOT drawn from the internal
# dataset: CI's data-validation gate (gym env test +should_validate_data=true) requires a
# committed sample, so these rows are synthetic fixtures built from SWE-Gym/SWE-Gym (MIT
# licensed, public) with a fixture run_script.sh + parsing_script.py pair that honours the
# delivery's harness contract (run the selected test files, emit {"tests": [{"name","status"}]}),
# so they exercise the same verification pipeline without publishing any real delivery content.
*.jsonl
!example.jsonl
!example_rollouts.jsonl
